{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Launchpad MK3 Chop Engine - Instant sampling & chopping from timeline to pads.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab [SEND] Send timeline range to the selected pad (time selection is cleared afterwards)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab [CHOP] Chop a range into 8/16/32/64 pads (spills over to the next pages)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab [ITEMS] Load every audio item of the source track into consecutive pads\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Pages: Launchpad arrows (or the scene buttons) switch page, up to 8 pages\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Gate / One-Shot / Loop (Hold or Toggle)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Multi-select (Shift = range, Ctrl/Cmd = one by one) and drag to move pads\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Kits: save / export / import with the chopped audio included (portable)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Runs in background when the window is closed. Delete the "LT Chops" track to stop it.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 v2.2: animation per pad (type, color incl. rainbow, speed, preview) in the pad menu; special pads: Metronome (blinks on the DAW beat, press = metronome on/off) and Stop sound. v2.1: Launchpad animations (Flash / Ripple / Cross / Sparkle), 8 pages always available, LED watchdog + single LED path (pads losing their color), 14 px drag threshold, Backspace no longer deletes pads. v2.0.2: only one engine can drive the Launchpad (a newer one retires the older); own window id so an old v1.x window can no longer hide behind it; LED resync after kit load. v2.0.1: the shortcut / action reopens the window (relaunch was being ignored). v2.0: pages, router JSFX (auto-installed), loop toggle, multi-select, drag-move, portable kits, background engine, settings panel, collapsible inspector, color picker, credits. v1.6: choke cuts fade out (release) instead of hard-cutting. v1.5: micro-fade (attack/release) on every pad.\par}
}
